1. Remove the `INT_MAX` `min_t`: it is unreachable, since a page array of 2^31 entries would be 16 GiB.
2. Check `fatal_signal_pending(current)` on each iteration (and fail with `-EINTR` through `err_unpin`), so pinning a very large blob can be interrupted.
